# Ground truth for English (DESIGN.md 16.5). One case per line: text, context, expected steps.
# Contexts are in contexts/, recorded in FreeCAD 1.1.4 with tools/record_context.py.

# --- Commands by name (PartDesign)
{"text": "Pad", "context": "fc114_partdesign", "expect": ["PartDesign_Pad"]}
